title: The LSSP Offensive

= The LSSP

The LSSP labels the SLFP as another bourgeois party serving in interests of the rich and elite.

- @moveon: We are immedietly faced with a decline in our support among working class and some rural Sri Lankan's.

@moveon
on-arrival: rural_slfp -= 0.5; workers_slfp -= 1.5; 